  "title": "Birthday Bash",
  "text": "thumb|350px\nThe Birthday Bash is an annual event held throughout the month of April in celebration of launch day for Free Realms on April 29th, 2009. The event features party items, and Cakenstein, along with his minions out to take the Birthday Cake, it is up to the players to stop them.\n\nQuestline\nThe quests for this event are centered in Sanctuary, but send you all around Sacred Grove. Speak with Camellia to get things started.\n\n A Piece of Cake from Camellia in Sanctuary  - repeatable once per day\n Undelivered Confections from Camellia\n Mysteriously Cakey Remains from Chef Jarvie in Merry Vale\n Cakey Clue from Mayor McFairy in Merry Vale\n To Bake a Pretty Cake from Glerga in the Robgoblin Camp \n Perfecting the Batter from Glerga \n All Cakensteins Must Die from Glerga \n Forgivable Matter from Glerga \n\n Birthday Cake Bake-Off from Camellia\n Helping the Local Chef - repeatable once per day with your chosen chef\n Birthday Invitation from Flitter in Sanctuary - repeatable once per day\n Bundles of Balloons from Quills in Sanctuary - repeatable once per day\n Cakey Madness from General Glowlight in Sanctuary - repeatable once per day\n Downing Cakenstein from Commander Kiggle in Sanctuary - continuously repeatable\n Feeding the Crowd from Helga Humbleloaf in Pixiewood Hills - repeatable once per day\n Mystery Meat Mystery from Sal Monella in Blackspore Swamp - once per character (so if done in a previous year, it will not be offered again)\n\nWhere's the Party?\nAll of the major towns in Sacred Grove each have their own special party location.\n\n Sanctuary - On the island south of the Royal Palace\n Merry Vale - At the cooking table\n Seaside - At the Ocean Treasures Cafe\n Briarwood - At Chugilda's camp kitchen in Nettleseed\n Snowhill - Near the cooking table and the skating pond\n W"
